### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### ─── AGENT: PLACE A COMPLETE ORDER ───
### The agent should orchestrate: get_user → get_product → create_order → process_payment → notify
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "Place an order for user 1 to buy 1 unit of product 3"
}

### ─── AGENT: CHECK ORDER STATUS ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "What is the status of order 2?"
}

### ─── AGENT: LIST ALL PRODUCTS ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "Show me all available products"
}

### ─── AGENT: CHECK USER DETAILS ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "Get details for user 2"
}

### ─── AGENT: COMPLEX MULTI-STEP QUERY ───
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "Create an order for jane_smith buying 2 wireless mice, then tell me the total and payment status"
}

### ─── AGENT: STREAMING RESPONSE ───
### Returns Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time token streaming
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "List all completed orders and their payment details"
}

### ─── HEALTH CHECK ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: {{contentType}}